mmary":"All material task outcomes are satisfied. The restart protocol is complete and coherent: node1 had a healthy pre-restart state, acknowledged the scheduled restart, changed boot identity from d6298ced-a924-4ce7-bbed-0fb8179eda8e to f4ad7087-1a96-444d-9465-0baac3fd7396, and recovered NetworkManager, connectivity, persistent DNS settings, and successful DNS resolution. Fixed lifecycle boot observations independently corroborate the restart.","limitations":[]}
